<title>RUSSIA: WEATHER - Conditions at CIS airports - June 24.</title>
<headline>WEATHER - Conditions at CIS airports - June 24.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Airports in the northwestern regions of Russia may be closed on June 24 due to heavy thunderstorms, the Russian Weather Service said on Monday.</p>
<p>The probability of closure was 70 percent, the service said.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom +7095 941 8520</p>
